{"parse": {"title": "三重赋格-01", "pageid": 110905, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E6%88%8E%C2%B7%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC\" title=\"卡戎·三重赋格\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">三重赋格-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E8%B5%8B%E6%A0%BC-02\" title=\"三重赋格-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">三重赋格</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.96.B2.E6.83.AB.E4.B8.BB.E4.B9.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"疲惫主义\">疲惫主义</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 疲惫主义</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Exhaustion</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_zhanhao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_zhanhao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火炮声终于停息，毒气也消散殆尽，士兵们正陆续从防空洞里钻出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们挥开余烬和烟尘，再一次打量世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>那边的新兵还没有回过神来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>看来你也没有……到现在我也分辨不出你是反应迟钝，还是正在走神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>千万注意脚下，摔进弹坑里得遭不小的罪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>……不过我说这话好像显得有些多余，我们也不是第一次做战场清扫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喋喋不休的士兵掰掉战友识别牌的下半，然后审慎地把钢盔盖在了战友的脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>当毒气还在防空洞里蔓延，他就摘下了防毒面具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>新兵最容易犯这样的错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>他们对安全和危险的判别，都依赖自己的感受。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>他们太希望该死的毒气早点散去，以至于欺骗了自己，所以他们面目全非地躺在了这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎费了些时间看清他眼中的阴翳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你很难过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>哈！难过是什么感觉？我要是知道，我就没法在这儿继续呆下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我理解，在战壕里生存，几乎所有的感受都会消失，最后只剩下忍耐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你想为他念祷词吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>那不是你该做的事情吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你知道我并没有信仰，但是如果念祷词可以让人们感到好受，那么我会去做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>好吧，好吧，你去看看那边的倒霉蛋们，这小子和我是同乡，我来送他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵在他那位同乡面前站直，似乎是在竭力撇掉身上的那股痞气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎注视了他一会儿，随后转身，推动他那架用活动木板搭成的小车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>噢，卡戎，哪里有死者，哪里就有你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵们摇晃着手里装有识别牌的袋子，向他简短地打了招呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>弗兰兹应该很伤心，躺着的那小子是他中学老师的孩子，他一直很照顾那小子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>他天天给那群新兵上课，教他们分辨轻重炮弹的嗡鸣，教他们掐准手榴弹的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>在恐惧面前，这些知识会被忘得一干二净。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>总之，他尽力了，我们都尽力了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎没再答话，遗体的识别牌已被掰下，他检查了那截摇摇欲坠的手臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵们像往常那样帮他扶起遗体的头脚，然后一起一落，小车发出嘎吱声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>……该死，又是“告别时间”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵们骂骂咧咧，但卡戎的目光却放在不远处的泥泞上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卷曲的黑白三角，它的下半部分被淹没在泥水之中，但依然鲜明得足够引起注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它在风中颤颤巍巍地抖动，犹如等待撷取的花瓣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>卡戎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>确实很难分清他是走神还是反应慢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎走上前，轻轻地抽出了那张相片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>……等等，这是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在泥泞、硝烟、火炮、苦痛和死亡之外的另一个世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个女性将她的头发梳得一丝不苟，怀抱一把新鲜的矢车菊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>用柔情暗昧的面容，对着这个世界微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>噢！这是谁呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>应该是谁的妻子，呃，也可能是妹妹、母亲？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>那么她的丈夫、哥哥或者儿子在哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你们有可能知道这张相片的主人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-526901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>至少我们连没有这号人，我可以很肯定地这样说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我明白了，我会到处问问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡戎打开随身的笔记本，将那张相片夹了进去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不远处的人群突然骚动，呼喝声迭起交错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>卡戎！来帮帮忙！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-529001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">弗兰兹：</div><div>这里有个没死的伤兵，担架和人手都不够，你送他去野战医院吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵拍了拍卡戎的肩膀，后者回过头来，短暂地消化了弗兰兹的呼唤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>好，我来送他。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从卡戎踏进医院开始，一道视线就落在他身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到他运送来的伤兵被护士们接管，视线的主人才走上前来与他搭话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>卡戎，艾伯哈特的士官，是吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是的，长官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>你倒是个蛮有意思的家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>一个死而复生的士兵，拒绝了宣传部的要求，抛弃了升衔获勋的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>你到前线来，就为了收殓士兵和运送伤员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>看来你不善言辞，拒绝宣传部倒也合情合理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我以为您这样的长官，会对我拒绝宣传部的事情颇有微词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>哈哈，没那回事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>人们总在谈论英雄主义和钢铁青年，高中生们因为这些口号涌向了战场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>他们以为这是一次奥德修斯之旅，最后却踏进一篇与想象背道而驰的悲剧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>而你实行的是自己的英雄主义，即使这和“我们”的意志无关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>可能其他人会认为你是个怪人，但我欣赏你，也希望自己能理解你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……不，中校，我想您误会了，我与任何主义都没有关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我只是对这一切都感到疲惫而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻的沉默。中校的目光放得很远，似乎落在不具名的彼方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>你很诚实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我只是认为我没有说谎的必要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>四天之后，这所野战医院就会撤到后方，因为这里也很可能变成前线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>到时候，会有许多伤员和遗体被留下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我会体面地安葬他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>看来你对战争中的无可奈何已经习以为常，即使是这种非人道的抛弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>我的愤怒或抗议都无足轻重，我只会做好那些我能做到的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>短暂的谈话拉长了他们身上的滞重，沉默过去之后，中校向他告了别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-528801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沃尔克中校：</div><div>那么，我要去做我该做的事情了——我们应该还会见面的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>再见，中校。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如同齿轮转动，卡戎明确自己的下一步是取回自己十分钟前放下的笔记本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他抬步转弯，回到刚刚将士兵转移上担架的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有限的视野中，他的笔记被人捧在手里，书页中的蝴蝶纹样随同她的双手微微颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看过来，没有丝毫查看他人私人物品的歉意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这是你的笔记本？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>很漂亮的蝴蝶纹样，你喜欢蝴蝶标本吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对卡戎的沉默，女性似乎不以为意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我有两位认识了将近二十年的朋友——这个数字意味着我们从记事开始就认识了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我和哥哥是孤儿，所以这两位朋友就像我的家人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>一位是我的未婚夫瓦尔特，他死在战场上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>另一位喜欢收集蝴蝶标本，我和瓦尔特总是坐在他家的楼梯下面等他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>他会拿来他的标本，神采飞扬地向我们介绍——那是他少有的，神采飞扬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>据我所知，我的这位朋友也已经死在了战场上，但有些可笑的流言，说他复活了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她蓝色的眼睛睨着他，像月光堆积在湖底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我当时不信，但现在似乎我必须相信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-527902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……帕蒂塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕蒂塔：</div><div>保罗，你为什么不回家？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "三重赋格-01"}}